## Development

Requires Go, make, and [golangci-lint](https://golangci-lint.run/).

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make build` | Build `bin/{{project_slug}}` |
| `make test` | Unit tests |
| `make test-integration` | Integration tests against the built binary |
| `make lint` | golangci-lint |
| `make vuln` | govulncheck |
| `make coverage` | Race-enabled tests with a coverage floor |
| `make ci` | Everything CI runs |

See [docs/DEVELOPMENT.md](docs/DEVELOPMENT.md) for more.

